Package: urban-model-server
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3,
 python3-networkx,
 python3-shapely,
 python3-lxml,
 libcitisim
Description: Services that allow queries about a model based on the IndoorGML standard
 This package provides various services. On the one hand there is the one in
 charge of serving the IndoorGML model indicated to the server through the
 "IgmlLayer" interface. On the other hand there is the service in charge of
 calculating routes between two points of the model and implements the
 interface "RoutingService" of the "SmartServices" module of the libcitisim
 package.
